# GitHub's Linguist does not know Firn. Without this file it labels this
# repository "Rust", because the bootstrap compiler is the only thing it
# recognises -- while over 300000 lines of the actual language are invisible
# to it. Better no language bar than a wrong one.
*.fi linguist-language=Firn
*.fi -linguist-detectable
compiler/**/*.rs linguist-vendored
docs/** linguist-documentation
tests/** linguist-documentation
